### ===========================================
### Private Notes API Tests
### ===========================================
### Prerequisites: Run 01-auth.http first to get bearer token

### ==================== Category CRUD ====================

### List all categories
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/category/list
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a new category
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/category
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Most Important",
  "description": "Key principles and reminders for daily life",
  "color": "#FF5733",
  "icon": "star",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Create another category
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/category
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Physical Health",
  "description": "Health and wellness reminders",
  "color": "#33FF57",
  "icon": "heart",
  "sortOrder": 2
}

### Get category by ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/category/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update category
PUT {{base_url}}/api/notes/category/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Most Important Notes",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "color": "#FF0000",
  "icon": "star-filled",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Delete category (physical delete - also deletes all items in category)
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/notes/category/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ==================== Note Item CRUD ====================

### List items in a category
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/list/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a note item
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/item
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "content": "Confronted with challenging tasks, challenge yourself to endure for at least 10 seconds. Extend this persistence to longer durations, like 1 or 5 minutes. Persist, stay focused, and avoid assuming success through luck. Instead, maintain determination until the task is successfully completed.",
  "imageStyle": "minimalist illustration"
}

### Create another note item
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/item
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "content": "I need to experience every moment where I am the one Lulu loves, and I need to deeply perceive that I am the one who is so good as to deserve being loved.",
  "imageStyle": "warm watercolor"
}

### Create a third note item
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/item
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "content": "Disable WeChat Moment, for the WeChat Channel, only focus on technical content. Don't develop the habit of frequently pulling down the notification bar to check for new messages.",
  "imageStyle": "clean modern"
}

### Get note item by ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update note item
PUT {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "content": "Challenge yourself to endure challenging tasks for at least 10 seconds, then extend to 1 or 5 minutes. Stay focused and determined until success.",
  "imageStyle": "motivational poster"
}

### Delete note item (physical delete)
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ==================== Navigation ====================

### Get next item (loops to first if at end)
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1/next
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get previous item (loops to last if at beginning)
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1/previous
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Reorder items in category
PUT {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/reorder/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[3, 1, 2]

### ==================== Audio Generation ====================

### Generate audio for a note item (US accent)
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/audio/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noteItemId": 1,
  "accent": "US",
  "voice": "alloy"
}

### Generate audio with UK accent
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/audio/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noteItemId": 2,
  "accent": "UK",
  "voice": "nova"
}

### Generate audio with Australian accent
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/audio/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noteItemId": 3,
  "accent": "AU",
  "voice": "echo"
}

### Stream audio for a note item (with header - for API clients)
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1/audio/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Stream audio for a note item (with query param - for browser media elements)
# Use this format when embedding in <audio> elements
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1/audio/stream?access_token={{access_token}}

### Delete audio for a note item
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1/audio
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

