### Stream image for a note item (with header - for API clients)
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1/image/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Stream image for a note item (with query param - for browser <img> elements)
# Use this format when embedding in <img> elements
