### Delete image for a note item
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/1/image
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ==================== Lock/Passcode Management ====================
### Note: When notes are locked, all category/item APIs will return error

### Get lock status (check if passcode is set and if locked)
GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/lock/status
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Set initial passcode (no currentPasscode needed for first time)
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/lock/passcode
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPasscode": "1234"
}

### Change passcode (requires currentPasscode)
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/lock/passcode
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPasscode": "1234",
  "newPasscode": "5678"
}

### Lock notes (requires passcode to be set first)
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Try to access categories while locked (should fail with "Notes are locked")
# GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/category/list
# Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Unlock notes with passcode
POST {{base_url}}/api/notes/lock/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passcode": "5678"
}

### Remove passcode protection (requires current passcode)
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/notes/lock/passcode?currentPasscode=5678
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ==================== Privacy Test ====================
### These tests should fail with "Access denied" if trying to access another user's notes

### Try to access another user's category (should fail)
# GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/category/999
# Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Try to access another user's note item (should fail)
# GET {{base_url}}/api/notes/item/999
# Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
